# Anything binary a map or tileset brings in later. Nothing here ships one
# yet, and this is in place from the start because git's binary detection is a
# heuristic over the first 8000 bytes: a lotpack silently rewritten by line
# ending conversion is close to undiagnosable.
*.lotpack   binary
*.lotheader binary
*.bin       binary
*.pack      binary
*.tiles     binary
*.xcf       binary
*.blend     binary
*.glb       binary
